/* ---------- PRODUCTS ----------
   TO ADD A PRODUCT: copy ONE line below, paste it at the end of the list
   (before the closing  ];  ), give it a new unique id (next number), and edit.
   The product then appears everywhere automatically: shop, its category
   page, the home page, search, filters and its own product page.

   id    unique number (higher number = "newest")
   b     brand label                 n     product name
   c     category name (must match a GROUPS name exactly)
   g     category slug (must match a GROUPS slug exactly)
   sub   subcategory (should be one of that group's "subs")
   s     short line shown on the card
   p     price in Naira              inst  installation fee in Naira (0 = no installation offered)
   i     icon: cam | box | lock | bulb | sens
   code  product code                d     description
   sp    spec table: [["Label","Value"], ...]
   box   (optional) what comes in the box
   old   (optional) the OLD price - shows a SALE badge and a struck-through price
   sale  (optional) 1 = show the SALE badge even with no old price
   img   (optional) image file name WITHOUT extension, inside /images/ , e.g. "lighting/lighting-01-xyz".
         Put the picture in that folder as .jpg (or .webp / .png / .jpeg). Until it exists, the icon shows.
   chk   (optional) 1 = I completed a cut-off product name, please double-check it   */
